  "notes": "Token prices vary by UTC peak/off-peak schedule; conditional prices are *_peak / *_off_peak fields, not a universal native rate. Official shorthand context/output limits are not independently converted to integers. Peak: 01:00–04:00 and 06:00–10:00 UTC Monday–Friday excluding Chinese public holidays; all other hours off-peak. Conditional rates use *_peak / *_off_peak metadata, not distinct model routes."
